- **Step 0 triage — not triggered.** The strategy is not S-sized-single-team: it spans two components (Dashboard, KServe) and two teams (RHOAI Dashboard, RHOAI Serving), and includes substantive documentation authoring (HLR-5, a new troubleshooting topic — a distinct work-product stream).
- **Step 2 — component graph.**
